</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Sisters of Las (Nuns) Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Info supplied by Aczer, a lvl 40 drow.  8-27-97.

Name: Sisters of Las
Command: nuns
Creator: Teutonic
Your level: 19
Maximum level: 30

Description:
Commonly referred to as Nuns, the Sisters of Las possess a very powerful and
unique blend of magic.  Their studies combine limited healing abilities,
potent offensive spells and protective auras. Nuns are well educated and chose
to live in poverty, always putting the needs of others before theirs.  The
teachings of Las, the God of Justice are used to battle the evil entities of
the world.

Joining requirements:
 Background must be good_religious (passed)
 Alignment must be good (passed)
 Gender must be female (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 Receive a gift from Las
 May train skill Cast generic to 16%
 May train skill Cast magical to 16%
 May train skill Consider to 16%
 May study spell Light to 19%

